xt":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment funnel analysis"},{"text":"Hiring metrics"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"People analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR + communication + Excel","Year 2: Sourcing + screening + ATS","Year 3: Recruitment analytics + technical/non-technical hiring","Final Year: Recruitment portfolio + internship","0–2 Years: Recruiter / TA Associate","2–5 Years: Senior Recruiter / TA Specialist","5–8 Years: TA Lead / Manager","8–15 Years: Head of Talent Acquisition","15+ Years: Director / VP Talent / Chief People Officer"],"label":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Recruitment Internship","LinkedIn/Boolean Sourcing","ATS/HRIS","Advanced Excel","Power BI","HR Analytics","AI Recruitment Tools","strong communication","measurable hiring experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Key principle","text":"A successful recruiter is not simply someone who fills vacancies. The strongest professionals understand business requirements, identify the right talent, assess candidates fairly, manage candidate experience, use recruitment technology, and improve hiring decisions through data."}]}]}